Z||000000||johnmac||06-29-2001||05:48 PM||||What the cheapest insurance coverage available for my 86 GT in Florida? I will be going with a high deductible.<P>I plan to put about 10,000 miles on her every year.<P>Any suggestions?<P>------------------<BR>John MacHaffie<BR>86GT "Yellowbird"<BR>12+ month project car<BR>johnmac@mpinet.net<BR>Winter Springs, Florida||||reg||1
